{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_133_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "7da62115d305b17f046c39e7fac61b3e2857f63c5e5101bb69a472ebdc7c83ef", "ja": "あはは……なんか夢みたいでさ。オレ、あそこで\n歌ったんだよな……まだ信じられないぜ。", "zh": "哈哈……感觉就像在做梦一样。我，真的在那里唱过歌啊……到现在还是难以置信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
